think Read KYRI and RADIANT_STYLE to be Kyri in voice, then crux/REMEMBER, crux/REDS, and the top of session-logs/README to pick up the thread. The bench is deep in Season G open-media (210 image modules), building the scene-read interaction floor one composed rung per lap, each closing GREEN on metal.
think Standfast check: every living REDS row (80, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87, and the prose-note rows) reads Closed or Released; REDS #75 stays errata (a future-dated Testament stamp whose only true fix is a deep debride, custody gate #1, Keaton's hand). No open agent-closable red -- Standfast clear, new work sanctioned.
think Custody gates surfaced not crossed: the Microkernel double-seat's seL4 (GPLv2) / Genode (AGPLv3) study wants a gratitude-fetch plus a per-component license read (FETCH/LICENSE gate); a real-photo top-hat wants a fetch gate. Neither is agent-doable here. The open-media rung is the agent-doable Lindy-first crux.
think Crux-first choice among the card's named candidates: the two-click nearest relation, a genuinely NEW ternary arity in the click family (anchor plus two candidates), the most decisive move since the family had only one- and two-click reads. Built it as click_nearest, composing over click_relation.click_pair_distance rather than re-deriving any gap (compose not braid).
think The crux: nearness is a GROUP fact not a PIXEL fact, so the group-nearer candidate can be the pixel-farther tap. Designed a four-singleton scene (A anchor, B big block group gap 2, C small block group gap 6, F block group gap 2) where tapping B's far corner (9,6) sits Chebyshev 8 from the anchor while C's tap (7,8) sits 7, yet B wins by group gap 2 < 6 -- the inversion proven on metal.
obs GREEN on the FIRST full metal run, no code reds -- the scene numbers and the compose-over-click_relation design held on the first build. TAME bans clean (compound asserts split into named single asserts, >=2 invariants per fn), width-check exit 0, plain 7-bit ASCII, tame_style_check exit 0, living-docs lint GREEN, living-card ASCII GREEN.
obs Three public functions plus a Nearer enum: nearer_group (the verdict), nearest_candidate_gap (min of the two gaps), is_equidistant (the tie). A candidate sharing the anchor's group reads gap 0 -- the nearest possible, no refusal, since a surface may tap something already in the anchor's group. Background refuses EmptyClick, off-map PointOutOfBounds.
obs Council rota lap read item 27, recursion-prompts/README.md -- the balance-compass charter (Radiant, Twilight, TAME, CIVIC, compass rose, Lindy-first, reds-first held in harmony) and the reminder that per-increment commits on GitHub are the cleanest progress signal, which this round honors by shipping as its own signed round.
